{"seq":53,"slug":"scientific-computing-simulation","title":"科学计算与数值仿真","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation","rating":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":2.5,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学计算与数值仿真\">科学计算与数值仿真</h1><p>本 hub 面向工程师与科研人员，系统覆盖从基础数值方法到高性能计算实践的完整知识链条。读者将掌握线性与非线性方程求解、常微分方程数值积分、偏微分方程离散化三大方法体系，以及 MPI 并行与 GPU 加速的工程部署能力。</p>\n<p>四条主线按依赖关系递进：数值方法基础建立算法选择与误差分析的直觉；常微分方程数值解从显式单步法推进到刚性问题与保结构积分；偏微分方程数值方法展开有限差分、有限元、谱方法三条技术路线；高性能计算实践将算法落地到大规模硬件。</p>\n<p>与纯数学的数值分析教材不同，本 hub 强调工程实用性。每篇文档都围绕&quot;什么时候用什么方法&quot;和&quot;为什么这个方法在这里失效&quot;展开，而非罗列定理证明。条件数估计告诉我们何时结果不可信，稳定性分析解释为何步长必须受限，性能模型帮助我们在精度与计算时间之间做权衡。</p>\n<p>前置知识：线性代数（矩阵分解、特征值）、微积分（泰勒展开、多元微分）、一门编程语言（Python 或 C++）。不要求读者修过数值分析课程——所有核心概念均从工程动机出发逐步推导。具备 MATLAB 或 NumPy 使用经验将有助于快速理解示例。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与同分类兄弟 hub 的分工：概率论与数理统计 hub 侧重随机模拟与统计推断，本 hub 专注确定性数值方法与偏微分方程求解；机器学习 hub 讨论梯度下降等优化器的统计学习视角，本 hub 的非线性求解器服务于方程求根而非参数拟合；微分方程 hub 侧重解析解与定性理论，本 hub 关注离散化算法与计算实现。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：零基础读者按章节顺序通读，每章三篇文档构成&quot;算法—理论—实践&quot;的微缩闭环。有数值分析基础的读者可从第二章或第三章切入，遇到基础概念再回查第一章。HPC 工程师可直接进入第四章，但建议先浏览前三章了解求解器的算法特性，因为并行效率与算法的数学结构紧密相关。</p>\n<p>应用场景贯穿全文：计算流体力学中的 Navier-Stokes 求解、结构力学中的有限元分析、量子力学中的薛定谔方程谱方法、化学反应动力学中的刚性 ODE 系统、气象预报中的大规模并行 PDE 求解。这些场景展示了数值方法如何从理论走向工程实践。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：<a href=\"../../mathematics-statistics/linear-algebra/\">线性代数</a>、<a href=\"../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/\">概率论与数理统计</a>、<a href=\"../../ai-ml/machine-learning/\">机器学习</a></p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-methods-foundations","title":"数值方法基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations","docs":[{"seq":0,"slug":"2-nonlinear-root-finding","title":"非线性方程求根","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/2-nonlinear-root-finding"},{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-system-solvers","title":"线性方程组求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/linear-system-solvers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-integration-differentiation","title":"数值积分与微分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/numerical-integration-differentiation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ode-numerical-solutions","title":"常微分方程数值解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/ode-numerical-solutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"single-multistep-methods","title":"单步法与多步法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/ode-numerical-solutions/single-multistep-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stiffness-stability","title":"刚性问题与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/ode-numerical-solutions/stiffness-stability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"geometric-numerical-integration","title":"几何数值积分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/ode-numerical-solutions/geometric-numerical-integration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pde-numerical-methods","title":"偏微分方程数值方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/pde-numerical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"finite-difference","title":"有限差分法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/pde-numerical-methods/finite-difference"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finite-element","title":"有限元法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/pde-numerical-methods/finite-element"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-pseudospectral","title":"谱方法与伪谱法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/pde-numerical-methods/spectral-pseudospectral"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hpc-practice","title":"高性能计算实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-mpi","title":"并行计算与 MPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/parallel-mpi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpu-cuda-acceleration","title":"GPU 加速与 CUDA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/gpu-cuda-acceleration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"perf-analysis-optimization","title":"性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/perf-analysis-optimization"}]}]}